<title>MEXICO: Autrey sets annual cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Autrey sets annual cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican company Grupo Casa Autrey (Autrey) said on Friday it will pay an annual cash dividend of 0.13632645 pesos per Mexican share and 1.36326448 pesos per American Depositary Receipt (ADR).</p>
<p>In an announcement in Mexico City newspapers, the pharmaceutics distributors said the dividend would be paid on each of 280.15 million shares after May 21.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
</text>
